{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22324","headline":"寄元九 · 白居易","name":"寄元九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身爲近密拘，心爲名检缚。\n月夜与花时，少逢杯酒乐。\n唯有元夫子，闲来同一酌。\n把手或酣歌，展眉时笑谑。\n今春除御史，前月之东洛。\n别来未开颜，尘埃满尊杓。\n蕙风晚香尽，槐雨余花落。\n秋意一萧条，离容两寂莫。\n况随白日老，共负青山约。\n谁识相念心，韝鹰与笼鹤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22324.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22324","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}